{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方金色大字“憋着一股气”，随后被下方同样醒目的灰白大字“那点高兴还没退”吸引。正文和右上角目录属于次级视觉信息。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。能感觉到人物处于某种情绪状态，但具体遭遇或眼下的处境没有直接抓到。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋着一股气、有些压抑或不甘，同时还残留着一点高兴；两种情绪似乎并存。\",\n  \"missed\": \"想往前走却脚下乱了步子的处境，以及和弦像重锤、节奏忽强忽弱、旋律彼此缠绕、调性抓不住重心等进一步解释。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里、要拼起来才懂：大字主要表达情绪，具体处境藏在下面的正文里。\",\n    \"单块较长、一块里有好几层意思：正文连续描述步伐、和弦、节奏、旋律和调性，需要进一步阅读才能理清。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e92d3ee1-f2f0-4f1e-9e3a-b27afe06af1d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022317441774Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:23:40.827540+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37538a29843cce4920ba2264f601f49f7152d0e9b8bd21321d77d17ae1a8d207", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "